  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Wednesday 4 November 2026 at 4:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPositioned on a sought-after street just a short stroll from Mission Bay’s beach, cafés and waterfront dining, this beautifully renovated home offers an exceptional combination of modern comfort, convenience and effortless summer living.\r\n\r\nFully renovated with contemporary finishes throughout, the home offers a fresh, stylish backdrop for relaxed everyday living, with a heat pump ensuring year-round comfort. Three spacious bedrooms provide flexibility for guests, a home office or a creative studio, while seamless indoor-outdoor flow makes hosting friends feel natural and easy.\r\n\r\nThe low-maintenance outdoor spaces are made for barbecues, alfresco dining or simply soaking up the sun. Whether you’re a first-home buyer, a couple seeking a lock-and-leave coastal base or downsizing to the beach, this home captures the very essence of refined coastal living.",
